{"version":2,"sourceHash":"8ba562241517e1e324fbb5326f4ec69210a15b0a6dae5c333b57fe04c2e0c36e","locale":"zh-TW","id":"ep-15","no":"EP.15","tag":"第15話 · 洗劫金庫","title":"洗劫金庫","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-15:1","s":"n","t":"鐘樓後門，比想像中簡陋。小門勉強夠一個麵包籃通過，上面掛著生鏽的升降機繩索。","bg":"jaeEnter","tone":"dark","bgm":"midnightPulse","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"jaeEnter","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jaeEnter","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jaeEnter 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-15:2","s":"ln","t":"姊姊每天清晨，都從這裡把麵包送下去。給守金庫的叔叔們當早飯。","x":"worry","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"c":{"who":"ln","x":"worry"},"r":{"who":"yun","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-15:3","s":"yun","t":"多虧露娜小姐，我們跳過了正門的七重關卡。今天的頭號功臣。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-15:4","s":"ln","t":"那我有五星嗎？","x":"cheer"},{"id":"ep-15:5","s":"yeon","t":"五星，再加一枚小花印章。姊姊醒了，告訴她。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-15:6","s":"n","t":"廣場盡頭，一盞燈晃動著。穿藍制服的兔子巡邏兵，打著呵欠走過。"},{"id":"ep-15:7","s":"neo","t":"低頭。每到整點，巡邏就繞一圈。離下一次整點還有四分鐘。","x":"serious","c":{"who":"neo","x":"serious"}},{"id":"ep-15:8","s":"yeon","t":"（四分鐘。在這座島，四分鐘夠買一個半麵包。）","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-15:9","s":"moka","t":"看那隻巡邏兔的耳朵。聞到烤串味，一動一動的。牠也餓了。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-15:10","s":"n","t":"巡邏兵一轉過街角，四人便從一處陰影跳進另一處。露娜走在前面，提起小門的門閂。"},{"id":"ep-15:11","s":"n","t":"升降籃吱呀著下降。四人和露娜依次攀住繩索，滑進黑暗。","sfx":"door"},{"id":"ep-15:12","s":"n","t":"第一層是工廠。數百人默默操縱機器。機器裡落下的不是錢幣，而是滴答作響的沙粒。","bg":"jaeSlave","tone":"dark","bgm":"memWater","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"jaeSlave","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jaeSlave","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jaeSlave 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-15:13","s":"yeon","t":"這些全是守衛？看起來更像工人啊。","x":"fear","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"fear"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"moka","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-15:14","s":"yun","t":"這一層，是用勞動償還欠下的時間。在這裡工作，日子不會流逝。但也不能回家。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-15:15","s":"n","t":"工人們的臉，無一例外都很模糊。有孩子，也有老人。在這些模糊的臉之間，一隻大貓熊正強忍著睏意。"},{"id":"ep-15:16","s":"moka","t":"都是飢餓的臉。失去味道的臉。","x":"moved","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jaeSlave","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jaeSlave","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jaeSlave 배경에서 진행되는 moka의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-15:17","s":"moka","t":"計畫改一下。不是迷住，是餵飽他們。香味干擾算附贈。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-15:18","s":"n","t":"摩卡點燃攜帶式火爐。二十串辣味烤串同時滋滋作響，工廠裡的空氣彷彿也搖動了。","sfx":"fire"},{"id":"ep-15:19","s":"n","t":"機器聲一臺接一臺停了。工人們抬起頭。模糊的臉龐之間，吞口水的聲音傳了開來。"},{"id":"ep-15:20","s":"moka","t":"排隊。不收錢。不過好吃，就說好吃。這就是價錢。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-15:21","s":"n","t":"貓熊第一個領到烤串。咬下一口，模糊的眼角一瞬間清晰起來。好吃。聲音很小。","im":true,"scene":{"background":"jaeSlave","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jaeSlave","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jaeSlave 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-15:22","s":"yeon","t":"聽見了嗎？牠說好吃！","x":"happy"},{"id":"ep-15:23","s":"moka","t":"當然。這次可是真正的味道。","x":"only"},{"id":"ep-15:24","s":"n","t":"烤串隊伍的末尾，站著一個小孩子。是一隻垂耳小兔。孩子領了烤串卻沒有吃，只盯著自己的手腕。"},{"id":"ep-15:25","s":"yeon","t":"不吃嗎？很好吃的。","x":"gentle","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jaeSlave","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jaeSlave","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jaeSlave 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-15:26","s":"n","t":"孩子伸出手腕。小小的數字在閃爍。距回家尚欠：00:01:00。"},{"id":"ep-15:27","s":"yeon","t":"一分鐘？就因為一分鐘，才待在這裡？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-15:28","s":"n","t":"孩子點點頭。在烤串的香氣那頭，小聲說，再幹一分鐘，就能回媽媽那裡。"},{"id":"ep-15:29","s":"yeon","t":"（一分鐘。我掙來的十二分鐘，應該……）","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-15:30","s":"yun","t":"女士，現在不行。那是打開第七格門的代價。回來的路上，再看看吧。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-15:31","s":"yeon","t":"等著。回來的時候，我一定來。烤串趁熱吃。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-15:32","s":"ln","t":"跟姊姊麵包的香味很像。暖暖的味道。","x":"joy"},{"id":"ep-15:33","s":"neo","t":"趁摩卡吸引注意，我們下去。從第二層開始，時間會變慢。","x":"serious","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"c":{"who":"neo","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"}},{"id":"ep-15:34","s":"yun","t":"露娜小姐留在摩卡先生旁邊。下面讓大人去。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-15:35","s":"ln","t":"不要。那是我姊姊的一天。我要自己找。","x":"worry"},{"id":"ep-15:36","s":"yeon","t":"那就一起到第三層。在那裡等著，我一定把姊姊的東西帶回來。約好了。","x":"gentle"},{"id":"ep-15:37","s":"n","t":"第二層。金色長廊延伸不盡。嵌在牆裡的儀表指針，像蜂蜜一樣緩緩移動。","bg":"jaeEnter2","tone":"dark","bgm":"crisis","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"jaeEnter2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jaeEnter2","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jaeEnter2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-15:38","s":"n","t":"邁出一步，腳就沉了下去。第二步，耳中自己的心跳聲，響得像雷鳴。","sfx":"heartbeat"},{"id":"ep-15:39","s":"yeon","t":"氣息……往上跑了。","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-15:40","s":"neo","t":"托住。像昨天一樣。往下放。","x":"calm"},{"id":"ep-15:41","s":"n","t":"Yeoni把氣息送到腹部下方。插在耳後的斷芽，輕輕搖了搖。腿又能動了。"},{"id":"ep-15:42","s":"n","t":"第三層門前，長廊猛地一震。地板翻轉，金屬手臂破地而出。沒有警報，是無聲的陷阱。","sfx":"thud","fx":"shake","scene":{"background":"jaeEnter2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jaeEnter2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"shake","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jaeEnter2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-15:43","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi向前躍出。金色利爪，一下斬斷三條金屬手臂。斷臂在緩慢的時間裡，緩緩墜落。","sfx":"slash","fx":"claw","scene":{"background":"jaeEnter2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jaeEnter2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"claw","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jaeEnter2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-15:44","s":"neo","t":"路開了。那扇門要由你來開。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-15:45","s":"yun","t":"好，好。鎖住的東西，我來吃。","x":"base","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jaeEnter2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jaeEnter2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jaeEnter2 배경에서 진행되는 yun의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-15:46","s":"n","t":"閏月把手掌貼上門把。整把鎖消失進掌心的洞裡。閏月的肩猛地一顫。","sfx":"whoosh","fx":"suck","scene":{"background":"jaeEnter2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jaeEnter2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"suck","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jaeEnter2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-15:47","s":"yun","t":"這島上的鎖，鐵味可真重。牙都痠了。","x":"pain"},{"id":"ep-15:48","s":"yeon","t":"叔叔，剛才又變大了吧。手伸過來看看。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-15:49","s":"yun","t":"如果女士握住我的手，說不定就不那麼疼了。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-15:50","s":"yeon","t":"這種話，等手不疼了再說！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-15:51","s":"n","t":"他們在第三層與露娜分開。露娜蹲在門前，伸出五根手指。五小時內回來。"},{"id":"ep-15:52","s":"n","t":"第四、第五、第六層。越往下，時間越濃稠。墜落的水滴停在半空，像珍珠一樣懸著。","bg":"jaeEnter2","tone":"dark","bgm":"crisis","shot":"wide","scene":{"background":"jaeEnter2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jaeEnter2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jaeEnter2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-15:53","s":"moka","t":"我好像要打噴嚏了。","x":"angry","c":{"who":"moka","x":"angry"}},{"id":"ep-15:54","s":"yun","t":"現在打，就是一星期。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-15:55","s":"moka","t":"知道。所以才忍著嘛。這裡真是個一星樓層。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-15:56","s":"n","t":"摩卡的鼻子抽動著。Yeongnyangi默默用斗篷下襬罩住摩卡的鼻子。噴嚏悄悄消失在繡著星星的內襯裡。","im":true,"scene":{"background":"jaeEnter2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jaeEnter2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jaeEnter2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-15:57","s":"yeon","t":"Yeongnyangi的斗篷，還有噴嚏過濾功能？加一星。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-15:58","s":"neo","t":"免費。僅限今天。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-15:59","s":"n","t":"第七格。巨大的圓形金庫敞開著。沿著牆壁，數千隻沙漏層層排開。","bg":"timeVault","bgm":"glassBox","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"timeVault","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: timeVault","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"timeVault 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-15:60","s":"yeon","t":"這些，全都是某個人的一天？","x":"surprise","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"surprise"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"}},{"id":"ep-15:61","s":"yun","t":"一天，一個月，十年。都是在這座島被賣掉、被奪走的時間。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-15:62","s":"n","t":"每隻沙漏裡，都有極輕的聲音。孩子的笑聲，煮飯聲，有人呼喚名字的聲音。那是被賣來的一天的聲音。"},{"id":"ep-15:63","s":"moka","t":"這裡的聲音都有味道。像誰家晚飯香味一樣的聲音。","x":"moved"},{"id":"ep-15:64","s":"neo","t":"別聽太久。跟著別人的一天走，你自己的腳也可能被纏住。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-15:65","s":"sys","t":"[ 露娜的姊姊 · 剩餘的今天 01:12:40 ]","fx":"script","scene":{"background":"timeVault","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: timeVault","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"script","camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"timeVault 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"}},{"id":"ep-15:66","s":"n","t":"Yeoni逐個掃過名牌。在第三排末尾，找到了畫著一雙沾麵粉的手的沙漏。"},{"id":"ep-15:67","s":"yeon","t":"找到了！姊姊的！上面畫著手！","x":"excited"},{"id":"ep-15:68","s":"n","t":"閏月奔向對面的牆。最下方一個抽屜上，沒有名字，只貼著空白名牌。抽屜是空的。"},{"id":"ep-15:69","s":"yun","t":"不在呢。應該放卯時的地方。","x":"void","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"timeVault","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: timeVault","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"timeVault 배경에서 진행되는 yun의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-15:70","s":"yeon","t":"叔叔……","x":"sad","pacing":{"pauseMs":350,"importance":"breath"}},{"id":"ep-15:71","s":"yun","t":"沒關係。那隻兔子大概隨身帶著。牠是連吃進去的東西，也捨不得放手的類型。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-15:72","s":"n","t":"這時，金庫中央傳來翻紙聲。極緩慢，又極清晰的聲音。","sfx":"page","bgm":"warCommand","scene":{"background":"timeVault","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: timeVault","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"timeVault 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-15:73","s":"n","t":"金庫中央的圓臺上，坐著黑虎。斗篷上攤開帳簿，腳邊放著一顆金色的蛋。","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"fear"},"c":{"who":"tiger","x":"base"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"angry"}},{"id":"ep-15:74","s":"tiger","t":"來晚了，豬。雖然早知道你會走麵包店的升降機。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-15:75","s":"yeon","t":"知道，為什麼不攔？","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-15:76","s":"tiger","t":"沒有守庫者會攔進來的客人。攔的是出去的客人。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-15:77","s":"n","t":"老虎翻過一頁帳簿。Yeoni看得清清楚楚。密密麻麻的紀錄中，只有一行空著。","im":true,"scene":{"background":"timeVault","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: timeVault","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"timeVault 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-15:78","s":"sys","t":"[ 花豬 · 未收 ]","fx":"ink","scene":{"background":"timeVault","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: timeVault","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"ink","camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"timeVault 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"}},{"id":"ep-15:79","s":"tiger","t":"有人叫我在下一座島，收走你的時間。沒想到你自己走到了金庫裡。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-15:80","s":"yeon","t":"誰叫你的。你的帳簿裡，連老闆也記著嗎？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-15:81","s":"tiger","t":"問題真多。債放著不管，會越滾越大。所以必須按時收回來。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-15:82","s":"yeon","t":"那你呢？你向誰借了什麼。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-15:83","s":"n","t":"老虎的尾巴停住。翻頁的前爪，在半空停頓了極短的一瞬。"},{"id":"ep-15:84","s":"tiger","t":"豬不需要知道。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-15:85","s":"yeon","t":"（剛才，牠回答不了了。）","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-15:86","s":"neo","t":"離Yeoni遠點。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-15:87","s":"tiger","t":"貓別插手。你不也已經裂了嗎。左爪。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-15:88","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi的左前爪微微一顫。Yeoni沒有看到。Yeoni的目光，正落在老虎腳邊的蛋上。"},{"id":"ep-15:89","s":"yeon","t":"（那顆蛋……為什麼這麼熟悉。好像身體裡面，有什麼在呼喚。）","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-15:90","s":"yun","t":"女士，就是那顆蛋。辰。您時支的字。辰土是倉庫。這整座金庫，都是建在那顆蛋上面的。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-15:91","s":"sys","t":"[ 年 □□ · 月 丙午 · 日 乙亥 · 時 □辰 ? ]","fx":"script","scene":{"background":"timeVault","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: timeVault","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"script","camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"timeVault 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"}},{"id":"ep-15:92","s":"yeon","t":"我的字，為什麼被壓在金庫底下？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-15:93","s":"n","t":"蛋彷彿認出了Yeoni，輕輕搖晃。金色的殼下面，有什麼在蠕動。"},{"id":"ep-15:94","s":"tiger","t":"時辰空著的命盤，就是倉庫敞著門的房子。誰都能進來，把東西堆進去。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-15:95","s":"moka","t":"話真多。把蛋拿來。姊姊的一天也拿來。","x":"angry","bgm":"warCommand","scene":{"background":"timeVault","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: timeVault","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"timeVault 배경에서 진행되는 moka의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-15:96","s":"n","t":"老虎甩了一下尾巴。黑水沿著地上的鐘錶指針漫開。一碰到腳踝，水就凍結了時間。","sfx":"water","fx":"water","scene":{"background":"timeVault","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: timeVault","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"water","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"timeVault 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-15:97","s":"neo","t":"別碰水！碰到就會停住！","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-15:98","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi抽出金線，分開水流。摩卡從水流裂開的縫隙中撲過去，把姊姊的沙漏抱進懷裡。","sfx":"slash","fx":"metal","scene":{"background":"timeVault","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: timeVault","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"metal","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"timeVault 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-15:99","s":"moka","t":"拿到了！姊姊的，在我懷裡！","x":"only"},{"id":"ep-15:100","s":"tiger","t":"那個可以拿走。本來就不在我的帳簿上。是兔子的份。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-15:101","s":"yeon","t":"那蛋我也拿走了。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-15:102","s":"tiger","t":"那個不行。","x":"angry","im":true,"shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"timeVault","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: timeVault","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"timeVault 배경에서 진행되는 tiger의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-15:103","s":"n","t":"Yeoni跳上圓臺。前蹄碰到蛋的一瞬，整座圓臺變成了巨大的鐘面。"},{"id":"ep-15:104","s":"n","t":"鐘聲響了七下。指針圍繞Yeoni旋轉一圈，透明玻璃牆便從Yeoni四周升起。","sfx":"bell","bgm":"crisis2","fx":"vortex","scene":{"background":"timeVault","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: timeVault","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"vortex","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"timeVault 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-15:105","s":"yeon","t":"動不了了！氣息……氣息沉不下去！","x":"shock"},{"id":"ep-15:106","s":"sys","t":"[ 時間陷阱 · 逃脫代價 72:00:00  持有 71:53:09  不足 00:06:51 ]","fx":"script","scene":{"background":"timeVault","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: timeVault","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"script","camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"timeVault 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"}},{"id":"ep-15:107","s":"neo","t":"Yeoni。","x":"shock"},{"id":"ep-15:108","s":"tiger","t":"我不會說對不起。帳簿裡沒有那一欄。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-15:109","s":"n","t":"玻璃牆外，金庫天花板的通風口裡，垂下兩隻藍耳朵。青兔倒掛在那裡，揮了揮手。","sfx":"whoosh"},{"id":"ep-15:110","s":"rab","t":"哎呀～剛好差六分五十一秒呢？要不要青兔金融借給您？利息真的只有一點點！","x":"invite","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"shock"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"rab","x":"invite"}},{"id":"ep-15:111","s":"yeon","t":"（借了，就能出去。不借，就會停在這裡。）","x":"fear","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"timeVault","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: timeVault","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"timeVault 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}}]}
